 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_TIMETABLE_CIV5_HEADING_2','The Grand Schedule'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_TIMETABLE_CIV5_TEXT_2','Non-capital cities connected to the Capital receive +1 [ICON_PRODUCTION] Production and +1 [ICON_RESEARCH] Science. After Railroad technology, non-capital cities connected by a continuous, fully owned, intact land railroad also receive +1 [ICON_CULTURE] Culture. Owned city centers act as junctions. Harbors qualify only for the ordinary connection bonuses.'),
